{"type":"message","id":"ffad798e","parentId":"5017fadc","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:24:23.000Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/Depression---6f6b4ff4-1443-4e94-a1c9-319ba6a8d47f.json (application/json) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/Depression---6f6b4ff4-1443-4e94-a1c9-319ba6a8d47f.json]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"564\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"sender\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-31 13:24 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\",\n  \"id\": \"495506013\",\n  \"name\": \"Matteo Cicalese\",\n  \"username\": \"CicaMatt\"\n}\n```\n\n[Telegram Matteo Cicalese (@CicaMatt) id:495506013 +5m Tue 2026-03-31 13:24 UTC] create a new skill under /home/node/.openclaw/skills, named \"depression-pipeline\", that has the same bahaviour of \"kidney-pipeline-execution\", with the following differences:\n• instead of an image, this time an audio file is sent through the chat by the user, leveraging after the same upload endpoint\n• replacing the same placeholder with the obtained path in the new json input format (that is attached)\n• send the request built \n\nthe new skill has to use the same final endpoint to forward the request, just with the new json input request. also, this time there is no image to forward in the chat\n\n<file name=\"Depression---6f6b4ff4-1443-4e94-a1c9-319ba6a8d47f.json\" mime=\"application/json\">\n{\n \"prototype_id\":\"69caabfc3b7b36bbd3dc49eb\",\n \"created_at\":\"2026-03-30T16:59:40.368000\",\n \"updated_at\":\"2